[{"title":"十一月十三日宿东林是日小雨不见庐山戏留绝诗于方丈","author":"郑刚中","text":"浓岚暮雨随人密，远壑幽峦向客悭。\n清旷本吾胸次景，不须云里觅衡山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34074,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十二月二日腊祭前一日致斋惠照呈清叟察院三绝 其一","author":"郑刚中","text":"峨冠执法公宜整，端冕临祠我亦严。\n深炷炉香通问讯，小寒清坐隔疏帘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34075,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十二月二日腊祭前一日致斋惠照呈清叟察院三绝 其三","author":"郑刚中","text":"柳眼浅窥湖水畔，梅花瘦著竹篱边。\n残年未便无冰雪，春意云何已断然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34076,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三月五日圃中","author":"郑刚中","text":"人愁春去少花枝，我爱园林春晚时。\n嘉木阴阴吐新叶，好风微度绿参差。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34077,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久雨","author":"郑刚中","text":"门前苔绿路无迹，窗下书昏云满楼。\n况是幽人本多睡，饮空小社一尊休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34078,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"子礼和道者寮古诗复遣一绝","author":"郑刚中","text":"苍璧方渐白鹿皮，琼瑶更似木瓜诗。\n从来持得吟诗戒，此是愚翁破戒时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34079,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"己