3e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无题","author":"郑刚中","text":"池塘好处烟迷柳，帘幕昏时雨过山。\n燕子不知春有恨，衔将花片入梁间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34098,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无题","author":"郑刚中","text":"雨出笋尖高玳瑁，风开花蕾入胭脂。\n恐须费尽东君力，造化无心本不知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34099,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水碓","author":"郑刚中","text":"绕岸车翻水碓鸣，谁于舂事亦经营。\n斯民惜费盖如此，力役从今莫漫征。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34100,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王能甫作葡萄一枝于圆扇之上戏作小诗报之","author":"郑刚中","text":"妙笔窥天顷刻成，浑如小架月初明。\n扶疏老蔓敷新叶，下盖累累紫水晶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34101,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长沙道中","author":"郑刚中","text":"微雨过云春半湿，晓风留雪柳偏寒。\n一身扶病方为客，马上哦诗强自宽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34102,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长春花","author":"郑刚中","text":"小蕊频频包碎绮，嫩红日日醉朝霞。\n气温已是如三月，更向亭前堆落花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34103,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代答","author":"郑刚中","text":"塞污锄蔓致蕃昌，草木怀君岂易忘。\n出为苍生施此手，他时宁使故园荒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34104,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出峡题舟中","author":"郑刚中","text":"才疏任重觉艰难，今日东归意已闲。\n勿谓一舟轻似叶，君恩端的重如山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34105,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"发风水洞","author":"郑刚中","text":"山逼新寒惊远梦，风收细雨作初晴。\n晓光微动鸥鹭起，黄叶乱飞旗帜明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34106,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"四月间读杜牧之荷叶诗一时回首背西风之句尝拟为立春绝","author":"郑刚中","text":"冰霜枯冻度穷冬，昨夜阳和始用工。\n多少柳条知此意，一时开眼望东风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34107,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用立春韵和卖药周道人","author":"郑刚中","text":"万金家信隔秋冬，欲往谁能化鸟工。\n迁客何为未幽死，直缘君有古人风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34108,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"甲子春晴久三月晦得频雨喜而为二绝句 其一","author":"郑刚中","text":"夜半风雷破久晴，四檐侵晓尚泠泠。\n欣然拥被重寻睡，梦见汉中春麦青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34109,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"甲子春晴久三月晦得频雨喜而为二绝句 其二","author":"郑刚中","text":"春晚郁蒸如溽暑，朝来萧飒似清秋。\n千山雨后阴云凝，三日楼前野水流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34110,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石希孟寄示赋论甚佳有未尽善处辄为涂改因成小诗寄之","author":"郑刚中","text":"寄我雄文丽且新，冰寒于水岂无因。\n故将丹粉画西子，要见浓涂淡墨人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34111,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"礼部直舍枯竹嫩筱丛燕雀飞来欲折以二韵记云","author":"郑刚中","text":"火边遗竹但枯枝，瘦笋丛生未及齐。\n筱嫩不禁风燕立，绿梢烟外起还低。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34112,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"休牧轩","author":"郑刚中","text":"自是牛图不早传，向来牛鼻不须穿。\n轩间缩手见真意，始悟控持非自然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34113,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孙立之以酴醾奉太守赠二绝予戏用其韵 其二","author":"郑刚中","text":"墙里一区谁氏宅，照墙不作夭桃色。\n翠条乞怪玉花繁，馨香借与新诗力。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34114,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寺前书院","author":"郑刚中","text":"竹屋纸窗无限好，观书学字不妨清。\n谁知夜梦饶惊枕，庄舄依前自越声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34115,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏简文浩然诗成不往也","author":"郑刚中","text":"临贺山泉清似政，公厨酿酒色如泉。\n因山相望虽千里，岂是江头无便船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34116,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏题秋香","author":"郑刚中","text":"香染鹅黄衣綷䌨，轻披环佩玉交加。\n异哉秋气方凄冷，风露何能作此花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34117,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏题堂前梅","author":"郑刚中","text":"健步移来知未久，危根犹用小栏遮。\n似能向我怜幽独，旋放南梢一两花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34118,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"早行二绝 其一","author":"郑刚中","text":"风柳惊霜日夜飘，客程中夜马萧萧。\n据鞍髣髴如残梦，晓月一钩犹未消。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34119,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"早行二绝 其二","author":"郑刚中","text":"赪肩携担又催程，寸许孤灯照壁青。\n破县残更误传晓，马行十里见明星。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34120,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"早春","author":"郑刚中","text":"雨过花梢些子湿，晓来窗下霎时寒。\n江乡此际春犹靳，长是疏梅带雪看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34121,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"早春有感","author":"郑刚中","text":"带烟柳外阴晴好，趁暖花苞日夜肥。\n有宅一区园十亩，不知天遣几时归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34122,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴","author":"郑刚中","text":"不似张苍作瓠肥，衰颜白发就昏痴。\n近来终日扃柴户，静看微风过竹枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34123,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴二首 其二","author":"郑刚中","text":"村酒向人虽是薄，寒梅于我未全疏。\n山斋独酌已半醉，自看小童寻晚蔬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34124,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴二首 其一","author":"郑刚中","text":"频婆随我泛江湖，更到南方一物无。\n相识只馀孤屿鸟，好看那有丈人乌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34125,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次桐庐","author":"郑刚中","text":"回舟逆水甚徐徐，尚距桐江百里馀。\n只有梦魂无阻碍，夜来先已到吾庐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34126,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"竹间见双蝶","author":"郑刚中","text":"东山桃李锦成堆，粉翅飞飞又却回。\n向此相随穿绿竹，须知端为道人来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34127,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"老翁真个似童儿汲井埋盆作小池退之句也去岁用此尝为小诗云半区茅屋裹疏篱无地容盆作小池祗有案头翻笔墨老翁髣髴似童儿邻舍老近以石方盆见借可容水三升置小鱼其间终日观之不厌复借退之全句成一绝","author":"郑刚中","text":"谁镌紫石仅如斗，我贮清泉将作池。\n养得小鱼终日看，老翁真个似童儿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34128,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"至日","author":"郑刚中","text":"寒风已是识新阳，昨夜千林不禁霜。\n七日欲知天道复，丈三先看土圭长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34129,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"至夜予编集经史专音","author":"郑刚中","text":"送纸迎神各就醺，病奴难唤自关门。\n暂收古训书千字，静对寒灯酒一尊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34130,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"至夜独酌二绝 其一","author":"郑刚中","text":"一册韩文酒一杯，居然独酌兴悠哉。\n夜寒径醉即就枕，卧待新阳明日来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34131,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"至夜独酌二绝 其二","author":"郑刚中","text":"久苦群阴不可排，一朝驱退亦宜哉。\n万年谁上君王寿，为奏门前欲泰来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34132,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观橘花","author":"郑刚中","text":"渐看绿叶秋来密，最爱轻花露未晞。\n何日增枝充素里，为渠临酒脱金衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34133,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过大冶县","author":"郑刚中","text":"吏民俱困市廛小，鸥雁相呼湖海宽。\n蕃息谁能力耕凿，弦歌依旧好为官。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34134,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"初寒","author":"郑刚中","text":"初寒未便成寒色，好似春时天气阴。\n手把菊花无一语，临风时嗅傲霜心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34135,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别家山二绝 其一","author":"郑刚中","text":"简书催我就征途，对坐西山暂索居。\n闻说仕途巇险甚，未应从此便相疏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34136,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别家山二绝 其二","author":"郑刚中","text":"就荒松菊莫相嗔，未肯微官缚此身。\n若有督邮须束带，定将秫米付他人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34137,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事","author":"郑刚中","text":"小径客来穿竹入，草亭凉到枕书眠。\n鸟呼人笑荔枝熟，如此封州已二年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34138,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事","author":"郑刚中","text":"梅子垂垂傍短墙，淡烟微雨暗池塘。\n年来自觉伤春甚，览镜欷歔泪数行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34139,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事二绝 其二","author":"郑刚中","text":"暮春景物称山家，屋角团团绿叶遮。\n薄晚微云疏过雨，一番小麦颤轻花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34140,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事二绝 其一","author":"郑刚中","text":"春风尽日恣颠狂，吹散游云夜月光。\n露带清寒入花骨，暗寻帘幕度幽香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34141,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事二首 其二","author":"郑刚中","text":"雨和山色得能好，风揽梅花个样香。\n本是吴侬归不早，青鞋天遣踏诸方。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34142,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事二首 其一","author":"郑刚中","text":"微凉可爱是薰风，岭外风行瘴雨中。\n渴暑四围如甑釜，不妨蒸得荔枝红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34143,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事五首 其五","author":"郑刚中","text":"日暮鸟雀瞑，空庭风雨悲。\n方知古今梦，同寄老槐枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34144,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事五首 其四","author":"郑刚中","text":"古寺孤云际，寒斋落叶中。\n消愁惟是酒，无柰酒尊空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34145,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事五首 其三","author":"郑刚中","text":"面西楼阁受午暑，傍砌蒲萄生暮凉。\n我作城居无去忆，一方新绿亦难忘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34146,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事五首 其二","author":"郑刚中","text":"窗外斜阳弄晚晖，酴醾更在小窗西。\n莫言无酒堪供醉，花气熏人已欲迷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34147,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事五首 其一","author":"郑刚中","text":"娟娟好是帘前竹，净绿相依乍晓时。\n万叶忽惊风不定，都翻宿雨下清池。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34148,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吴江有三高祠谓鸱夷子皮步兵校尉角里先生也先有一人题其祠曰是非名利等煎熬白尽英雄两鬓毛自古五湖风月好至今分付属三高因和之","author":"郑刚中","text":"外物由来如梦幻，达人轻视等毫毛。\n投身为有区区者，始觉诸公节行高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":34149,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]